Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see\Nthe world While I'm on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've yet to reach the end So won't\Nyou come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The storm that you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have not forget number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We set self cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh enough, stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are gonna find the mink tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they do, they're\Ngonna ask about Raizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're all super screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The search for some samurai who\Nwasn't even here was devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mokumo duktum was\Ndestroyed as collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, off we go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing to monkey around about!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the visitor's bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai! Samurai! Samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell anyone who is capable to follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm, a warning is ready\Nto go with your command, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That bell is rather cacophonous, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention ceaseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it is to announce\Nthe arrival of a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be welcoming us to their land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I confess, Sir Law's\Nwords leave me uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The allegedly human-hating inhabitants\Nhere are actually the minks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I doubt the\Nwords of our associate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but it just doesn't seem\Nto make any sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what people say,\Nthen I wonder what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We are reunited at long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not with Sir Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To be quite honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been ill at ease ever since\Nwe first set foot upon this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have been sleeping in a\Nroom apart from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pained to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When I awoke moments ago, I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I went searching to find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Curious that the others are missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's likely they're simply\Npreparing a welcome for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is doubtless the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to run before breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause Kin'emon and what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon and Kanjuro are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole country's already in an uproar,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ringing the visitor's bell\Nand yelling about samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Viper is running to the city\Nwith a team of guardians as we speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we'll get another feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure would be awesome\Nto do two days in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They were wrongly accused of hiding\Na samurai and nearly died for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find them right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,People are coming here from all directions,\Nso they should catch them along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Still haven't heard any\Nword about the samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My men are on the hunt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, we have to pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've noticed each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping fate anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please calm down, you're\Nboth still injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Some manner of altercation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,oh man that was close crazy close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you're in danger, don't say another\Nword and go back to the sunny quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,how many years has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you gotta look like a wreck,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you're one to talk, mutt seems you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm missing one of your legs down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop him quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not gonna be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Raizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding him somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me say it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no Raizo here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Search through the country as\Nmuch as you, Karoo, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll find no samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you'll say goodbye to this leg\Nfirst, or tell us where the samurai is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep hacking away\Nuntil you give me what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be, Dog King?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up Raizo, or give up your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So take the damned leg if you got or must.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you gotta do with one hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your lasagna\Nand eat yourself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Race?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from the land of Wano\Nhas no business in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make sure of\Nthat with your poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you cowardly curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, you don't think he's\Ngonna break the chains, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the gas really working?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Immobilize his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Better hurry, I'm breaking free!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My people are no threat to you,\NKaroo, but I won't go down so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna stab someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take every last spear you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:09:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so sad when I found out that\Nyou gotta had lost one of your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I was hoping you gotta\Nwould lose your life instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This land ain't got room for two kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've said enough, please stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well we can get rid of one\Nnow, since we're both here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this day. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog and a cat? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard those two were\Nstrong, but this is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Greg, you ruined everything you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:10:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A summoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Release me from your missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do all of you have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjino!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of here! Run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Viper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dubstorm, just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't mean this\Ncountry any harm, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Samurai Kin'emon, a\Nloyal retainer of the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,hailing from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here to reunite with my\Ncomrade Raizo, a fellow warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he be found in this land?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The country was practically\Ndestroyed because of it, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've longed for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear on my honor,\NI don't owe this Race.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If the man you're talking about is\Nhere, then you can take my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So Raizo is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And he is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me Rhizo has\Nbeen here from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and you all knew the whole country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But, but, you all nearly died and\Nnobody here said a single word!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This city stood for a thousand\Nyears and now it's ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we had to keep\Nit secret even from you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For many years, we have been like family\Nto the Kozuki clan from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can't be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our people would never sell out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports claim he attacked the Navy vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,transporting Doe Flamingo\Nand was soundly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do I look dead to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You look very alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to offer proof of our bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the crest of the Kozuki clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,for I have seen it upon our\Ntwo kings and Race as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.38,0:15:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, jeez, that didn't\Ngo like we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was getting ready for a fight, but\Nit turns out they're best buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no one's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be allies, but some\Nsecrets have to be kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So the doggy and the kitty have\Nthe same hidden crest as Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bond they share is that\Nstrong, it must be quite the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Viper. I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't certain I would find you\Ntwo alive and well, but here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We kept the faith, although death would\Nhave been a mercy after what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we waited here, we knew\Nwe'd see Yugara someday at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon was talking\Nto me, not you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Try waiting your turn for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon was clearly getting\Nbored talking to you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And since he is our esteemed guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be\Nconsiderate of me to take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not going to start\Nfighting again, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you, Karoo, take a catnap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep when I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help with that. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to go another round?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine with me, you three-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop! Both\Nof you! Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What has transpired to\Nmake you hate each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, in days past, you two used\Nto be the best of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I forbid you to ever fight again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and if it's over my father,\Nthen it makes it even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much it would break his\Nheart to say this—it's too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin would?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,would
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it would break his father's heart\Nto see this, but Kitaman's right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They both stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is bowing his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who he is, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I concur with what Lord Momonosuke says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I must apologize for this deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may have surmised,\NLord Momonosuke is not my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In all honesty, the boy that you see\Nbefore you is the son of Lord Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,great daimyo of Kuri in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This means Dogstorm, Catviper,\NKanjido, and myself honor him as lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki have an heir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a huge secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo is a big shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There are kings among his retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be a lord with substantial power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If our true identities were\Nrevealed during our travels I feared
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that it might attract the attention\Nof deadly enemies Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we pretended to be father\Nand son Forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not that I did not\Ntrust you So much as I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,struggled to find the right\Ntime to reveal the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought you were a family\NThey are quite alike, such naughty boys
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,forgive me for deceiving you in truth\Ni am a lord yes and a naughty one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm no such thing who cares not me i\Ndidn't ask for your opinion now bow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,down to me luffy it's me if you think\Nwe're gonna worship you all of a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sudden you need to get yourself a\Nreality check here shrimp lord momonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go again, yet we\Nowe our lives to Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a pirate after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's brash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And he keeps our lord occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's a brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how he fixes me, Onami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brat, remove your\Nhand, lest I smite you. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Momo, if your\Nfather is the Lord of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,his castle must be full of treasure. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a really bad person, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He faced that hardship only months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Their cheer is doing wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It might just save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep dwelling on the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just make the young lord suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,For his sake then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll extend my hand as an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But never as your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and so it shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My word!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They both made up? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the day and the\Nking of the night shaking hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can climb the whale from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got to learn which vines to\Ntake, it's possible to reach the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is where Ryzo's hiding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.46,0:22:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nin-nin! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real-life ninja! Nin-nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He stalks the shadows! Nin-nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel ill again, Kiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't force yourself if you're truly sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, the higher we go, the\Nlouder the voice in my head gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then be proud, your\Nfather had the same power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And he wasn't the only great man\Nwho heard the voice. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A real-life secret passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,On the tail of a whale!\NWho'd have thunk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if someone did come up\Nhere, the door is well hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long fall to\Nthe bottom. Don't slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.36,0:23:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Race, without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so close! Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.54,0:23:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.11,0:23:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Race, the great ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come at last, Cap Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you hand me over to the\Nenemy and spare your countrymen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who brought me\Nfood was grievously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart could scarcely take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.44,0:24:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told this land is safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If it fell to ruin while I was\Nheld here, I'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.76,0:24:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.90,0:24:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what ninjas are like at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.74,0:24:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you invaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.82,0:24:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.14,0:24:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.95,0:24:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, Kansuro, Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.64,0:24:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're all well!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.26,0:25:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the crest of the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Kinemon's tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.32,0:25:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The crest here has adorned this\Nsecret passage for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And that stone, the deep red, I've\Nnever seen one in such an odd color.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that is a poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We know all about your\Nhistory, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.84,0:25:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told the people of\NOhara can read those words
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So can you tell me what\Nmakes this poneglyph unique?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.92,0:25:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the ones I've\Nencountered thus far were read.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.78,0:25:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't understand the significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:25:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This one has a different purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.02,0:26:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.16,0:26:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.84,0:26:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.04,0:26:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've all been glaring at me\Never since you walked in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.66,0:26:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.50,0:26:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.41,0:26:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you questioning me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.80,0:26:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse our friend's insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.98,0:26:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.96,0:26:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates are fine allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.00,0:26:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.22,0:26:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really a ninja, prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, throw a jerk in for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And meditate under a waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say nin and do some ninja magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.02,0:26:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, show us your Earth techniques first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've got to do fire next.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And water, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.94,0:26:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking too much of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you pirates like ninjas so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't because we're pirates, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.36,0:26:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.14,0:26:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oooooooope! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From the day they're born, every\Nman thinks ninjas are cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys are making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.54,0:27:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ever go out with a\Nkunoichi, a lady ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us your jump training.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.16,0:27:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Leap over some bamboo shoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do the shadow\Nclone technique, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the thing where you hide in the\Nceiling and get stabbed by a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon a giant frog and ride on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.80,0:27:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold a scroll in your mouth and\Nsay nin nin while you make pose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.06,0:27:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop imposing your\Nninja stereotypes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninjas don't say Ni-Nin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All of these ideas of yours are fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.06,0:27:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You bear, you got a\Nweird body and no moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.84,0:27:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.02,0:27:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.34,0:27:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This physique of mine doesn't make\Nme terribly popular with Kunoichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.74,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, rude! Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.52,0:28:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.34,0:28:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A true ninja master has a\Nquiet but resolute heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One who lives in the shadows does\Nnot put his techniques on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninjutsu is not a mere party trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.04,0:28:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Meatball!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.90,0:28:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.81,0:28:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoke escaped to Higgs! Nyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.46,0:28:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.42,0:28:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't disappear at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.82,0:28:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I'm right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.62,0:28:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.84,0:29:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And here, too. And here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.46,0:29:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my shadow phone technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare question my prowess?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.62,0:29:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower shuriken.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.75,0:29:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisible to the ladies,\Ninvincible in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise all of the mist has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.06,0:29:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.22,0:29:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With the story we got here!
